    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale by private Treaty this four bedroomed comfortable detached bungalow perched on an elevated site (0.44 acre) with pleasant views over the Blackwater River and distant valley. If you are a first time buyer this property could be for you offering a blank canvas to put your own stamp on what could be your new home. This property is conveniently located to a number of surrounding centres to include Clashmore Village (2.3km), Dungarvan Town (16.4km), Youghal Town (14.7km) and Ardmore Village with numerous surrounding beaches only 13.5km. This property also has two very popular Primary Schools within easy reach, Ballycurrane National School and Clashmore National School. The accommodation provides for entrance hall, sitting room, living room, kitchen / breakfast area, rear entrance porch off with utility room and shower room off, four bedrooms, family bathroom.\n\nViewing is invited strictly by appointment only with Selling Agents REA Spratt 058-42211. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n3.56m x 1.20m Tiled floor\n\nSitting Room\n4.80m x 4.25m Timber floor, open fireplace, generous built in fitted unit. Living room off\n\nLiving Room\n6.80m x 4.28m Dual aspect overlooking Balckwater River and Valley, timber floor. Wood burning stove positioned on raised heart, patio doors leading onto south west facing patio\n\nKitchen\n6.80m x 3.00m Tiled floor, airing cupboard off, generous fitted kitchen units with solid fuel range. Back entrance porch off\n2.5m x1.9m\n\nUtility Room\n3.30m x 1.80m Plumbed for washing machine, shower room off\n\nShower Room\n1.90m x 1.70m\n\nBedroom 1\n3.20m x 3.10m Carpet floor, measurement excludes built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2\n3.90m x 3.20m Dual aspect, timber floor, measurement excludes built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3\n4.00m x 3.00m Timber floor\n\nBedroom 4\n2.90m x 2.50m Timber floor\n\nBathroom\n2.90m x 1.85m Tiled floor, bath surround and shoer cubicle, Triton electric shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Vacant and early close of sale can be accommodated.\n-Spacious four bed detached bungalow.\n-Conveniently located to a number of surrounding centres.\n-Clashmore Village close by providing for sporting facilites, school, pubs, shop and church.\nAll floor coverings, all windows furnishings and all integrated appliances. \n Private Water.\nSeptic Tank.\nOil fired central heating."
      },
